{"id":"conv_04240","context":"A uni student talks to a teacher about a research-method dilemma","ambient":"office_quiet_low","cast":["ren_uni","asuka_teacher"],"tier":4,"lines":[{"speaker":"ren_uni","mood":null,"en":"Professor, my thesis data doesn't match my hypothesis at all... I'm a bit in despair.","jp":"先生、卒論のデータが全然仮説と合わなくて、ちょっと絶望してます…","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[1,4,6,9,13,14,19,57,197,228,521,1332,2898,4395,5083,5242,13968,14520],"jpTokens":[{"s":"先生","r":"せんせい","w":228},{"s":"、"},{"s":"卒論","r":"そつろん","w":13968},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"データ","w":521},{"s":"が","w":6},{"s":"全然","r":"ぜんぜん","w":1332},{"s":"仮説","r":"かせつ","w":5242},{"s":"と","w":9},{"s":"合わ","r":"あわ","w":2898},{"s":"なく","w":13},{"s":"て","w":4},{"s":"、"},{"s":"ちょっと","w":197},{"s":"絶望","r":"ぜつぼう","w":5083},{"s":"し","w":19},{"s":"て","w":4},{"s":"ます","w":14},{"s":"…"}]},{"speaker":"asuka_teacher","mood":null,"en":"Calm down. Many researchers face that exact wall.","jp":"落ち着いて。多くの研究者がその壁に直面するのよ。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[1,2,4,6,19,33,45,68,190,200,1395,1496,3239,3750,5157,11104,16510],"jpTokens":[{"s":"落ち着い","r":"おちつい","w":11104},{"s":"て","w":4},{"s":"。"},{"s":"多く","r":"おおく","w":190},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"研究","r":"けんきゅう","w":200},{"s":"者","r":"しゃ","w":45},{"s":"が","w":6},{"s":"その","w":33},{"s":"壁","r":"かべ","w":1395},{"s":"に","w":2},{"s":"直面","r":"ちょくめん","w":5157},{"s":"する","w":19},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"よ","w":68},{"s":"。"}]},{"speaker":"ren_uni","mood":null,"en":"I searched online for similar studies, but the conclusions are all over the place.","jp":"ネットで類似の研究を探したんですけど、結論がバラバラで…","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[1,5,6,7,8,17,21,26,109,200,457,1204,1528,3159,3918,4781,5258,6863,8490],"jpTokens":[{"s":"ネット","w":457},{"s":"で","w":7},{"s":"類似","r":"るいじ","w":5258},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"研究","r":"けんきゅう","w":200},{"s":"を","w":5},{"s":"探し","r":"さがし","w":3159},{"s":"た","w":8},{"s":"ん","w":26},{"s":"です","w":17},{"s":"けど","w":109},{"s":"、"},{"s":"結論","r":"けつろん","w":1528},{"s":"が","w":6},{"s":"バラバラ","w":8490},{"s":"で","w":21},{"s":"…"}]},{"speaker":"asuka_teacher","mood":null,"en":"There's always a reason behind numbers that don't add up. Let's review your methodology.","jp":"数字が合わない背後には、必ず理由があるの。方法論を見直してみましょう。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[1,2,3,4,5,6,13,14,22,28,29,252,380,388,425,615,1000,1054,2280,2898,3550,3723,4395,5186,7636,14520],"jpTokens":[{"s":"数字","r":"すうじ","w":1054},{"s":"が","w":6},{"s":"合わ","r":"あわ","w":2898},{"s":"ない","w":13},{"s":"背後","r":"はいご","w":5186},{"s":"に","w":2},{"s":"は","w":3},{"s":"、"},{"s":"必ず","r":"かならず","w":1000},{"s":"理由","r":"りゆう","w":380},{"s":"が","w":6},{"s":"ある","w":22},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"。"},{"s":"方法","r":"ほうほう","w":252},{"s":"論","r":"ろん","w":615},{"s":"を","w":5},{"s":"見直し","r":"みなおし","w":7636},{"s":"て","w":4},{"s":"み","w":388},{"s":"ましょ","w":14},{"s":"う","w":29},{"s":"。"}]},{"speaker":"ren_uni","mood":null,"en":"If I increase the sample size, can the margin of error be reduced?","jp":"サンプルサイズを増やせば、誤差は軽減できますか?","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[3,5,14,16,41,80,97,1567,2402,3885,4320,4886,5260,5964,10900,11603],"jpTokens":[{"s":"サンプル","w":4320},{"s":"サイズ","w":1567},{"s":"を","w":5},{"s":"増やせ","r":"ふやせ","w":4886},{"s":"ば","w":41},{"s":"、"},{"s":"誤差","r":"ごさ","w":10900},{"s":"は","w":3},{"s":"軽減","r":"けいげん","w":5260},{"s":"でき","w":97},{"s":"ます","w":14},{"s":"か","w":16},{"s":"?"}]},{"speaker":"asuka_teacher","mood":null,"en":"Yes. But truth doesn't lie only in numbers. You also need the courage to doubt the hypothesis itself.","jp":"ええ。でも真理は数字だけにあるんじゃない。仮説自体を疑う勇気も必要よ。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[2,3,5,11,13,22,26,64,68,88,116,132,844,1054,2961,3039,5233,5242,9568,14196],"jpTokens":[{"s":"ええ","w":3039},{"s":"。"},{"s":"でも","w":88},{"s":"真理","r":"しんり","w":5233},{"s":"は","w":3},{"s":"数字","r":"すうじ","w":1054},{"s":"だけ","w":64},{"s":"に","w":2},{"s":"ある","w":22},{"s":"ん","w":26},{"s":"じゃ","w":132},{"s":"ない","w":13},{"s":"。"},{"s":"仮説","r":"かせつ","w":5242},{"s":"自